#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
macrobloom_monolith.py

A single-file, overbuilt Macrobloom-inspired pipeline:
- Load assets from a mock generator or CSV
- Compute environmental scores (CO2 intensity + absolute CO2 penalty)
- Normalize and build a lightweight "factor space" for similarity matching
- Build swap candidates under sector/region locks
- Optimize portfolio weights to reduce environmental score while preserving exposures
  (sector/region exposure constraints + turnover constraint)
- Produce a detailed report + JSON output
- CLI included

This is intentionally long and complicated for portfolio/GitHub presentation.
"""

